        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overcome your past and become someone new. A game about love, loss and being lost in life.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Truer than You, you play as 26-year old non-binary Rin who’s recently moved to a big city to start their new life and a new position at the secretive company Truer than You, specializing in renting out actors for real life situations.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it’s up to you to do your gigs without breaking the company rules or becoming exposed. You'll navigate situations by making choices and having conversations to get a good rating. Maybe you'll even become employee of the month!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But playing someone else isn’t always easy. Sometimes you’ll end up in situations where the borders start to blur. You might even meet someone that you start caring a little extra for… Then, what do you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, as Rin gets on with their new endeavours, their past is catching up with them. Why did they leave thir old life behind, to start a new life as someone else? In time, they’ll have to deal with who they are and will become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Explore relationships and dilemmas connected to authenticity and roles in society </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Form deeper relationships with three different characters and reveal their back stories <br>💎 Queer-friendly cast of characters and relationship types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Choose from more than 1,100 options leading to multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Flowing conversation mechanic - decide when to speak (or not)</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overcome your past and become someone new. A game about love, loss and being lost in life.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Truer than You, you play as 26-year old non-binary Rin who’s recently moved to a big city to start their new life and a new position at the secretive company Truer than You, specializing in renting out actors for real life situations.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it’s up to you to do your gigs without breaking the company rules or becoming exposed. You'll navigate situations by making choices and having conversations to get a good rating. Maybe you'll even become employee of the month!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But playing someone else isn’t always easy. Sometimes you’ll end up in situations where the borders start to blur. You might even meet someone that you start caring a little extra for… Then, what do you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, as Rin gets on with their new endeavours, their past is catching up with them. Why did they leave thir old life behind, to start a new life as someone else? In time, they’ll have to deal with who they are and will become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Explore relationships and dilemmas connected to authenticity and roles in society </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Form deeper relationships with three different characters and reveal their back stories <br>💎 Queer-friendly cast of characters and relationship types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Choose from more than 1,100 options leading to multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 Flowing conversation mechanic - decide when to speak (or not)</p>",
        "short_description": "Overcome your past and become someone new in Truer than You. A choice-driven narrative adventure about love, loss and being lost in life. You're hired as a gig-working actor to play roles in real-life situations. Have conversations, get a good rating and follow the rules. All good?",
